* Total income
* Total true spending
* Fixed spending
* Variable spending
* Recurring spending
* Subscription spending
* Transfers
* Investment contributions
* Net cash flow
* Savings rate

Savings Rate = (Income - True Spending) / Income

Transfers between my own accounts must not distort cash flow.

