* Similar merchant name
* Similar amount
* Regular timing
* Monthly, annual or other repeated frequency

Create columns:

* Merchant
* Typical Amount
* Frequency
* Last Payment
* Next Expected Payment
* Subscription?
* Confidence
* Active / Possibly Cancelled / Unknown

